{\"version\":\"0.8.26+commit.8a97fa7a\"},\"language\":\"Solidity\",\"output\":{\"abi\":[{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"launchRegistry_\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"contract IPermissionedRegistry\",\"name\":\"subnameRegistry_\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"resolver_\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"bytes32\",\"name\":\"parentNode_\",\"type\":\"bytes32\"},{\"internalType\":\"string\",\"name\":\"parentName_\",\"type\":\"string\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"constructor\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"caller\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"name\":\"OnlyLaunchRegistry\",\"type\":\"error\"},{\"anonymous\":false,\"inputs\":[{\"indexed\":true,\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"agentId\",\"type\":\"uint256\"},{\"indexed\":false,\"internalType\":\"string\",\"name\":\"label\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"indexed\":true,\"internalType\":\"bytes32\",\"name\":\"node\",\"type\":\"bytes32\"},{\"indexed\":true,\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"ensTokenId\",\"type\":\"uint256\"},{\"indexed\":false,\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"operator\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"name\":\"SubnameIssued\",\"type\":\"event\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"name\":\"REGISTRATION_ROLE_BITMAP\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"uint256\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"agentId\",\"type\":\"uint256\"},{\"internalType\":\"string\",\"name\":\"label\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"operator\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"string\",\"name\":\"manifestURI\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"internalType\":\"string\",\"name\":\"serviceEndpoint\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"internalType\":\"string\",\"name\":\"consentContact\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"internalType\":\"string\",\"name\":\"pitPointer\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint64\",\"name\":\"expiry\",\"type\":\"uint64\"}],\"name\":\"issue\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"bytes32\",\"name\":\"node\",\"type\":\"bytes32\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"tokenId\",\"type\":\"uint256\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"name\":\"launchRegistry\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"name\":\"parentName\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"string\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"string\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"name\":\"parentNode\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"bytes32\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"bytes32\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"name\":\"resolver\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"name\":\"subnameRegistry\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"contract IPermissionedRegistry\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"bytes32\",\"name\":\"node\",\"type\":\"bytes32\"},{\"internalType\":\"string\",\"name\":\"windowText\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"internalType\":\"string\",\"name\":\"consentContact\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"internalType\":\"string\",\"name\":\"pitPointer\",\"type\":\"string\"}],\"name\":\"syncConsent\",\"outputs\":[],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\"}],\"devdoc\":{\"kind\":\"dev\",\"methods\":{},\"stateVariables\":{\"REGISTRATION_ROLE_BITMAP\":{\"details\":\"Same bitmap the ETH Registrar grants .eth owners at registration (tutorial canon):      manage own subregistry + resolver (+ delegate those), and transfer the name.\"}},\"title\":\"ENSv2SubnameIssuer \\u2014 the dedicated ENSv2 leg of the launch ceremony.\",\"version\":1},\"userdoc\":{\"kind\":\"user\",\"methods\":{},\"notice\":\"Called ONLY by the AgentLaunchRegistry at launch / consent-flip time.   Launch: `register()` on the family's ENSv2 UserRegistry (a PermissionedRegistry proxy,     deployed via the Verifiable Factory and pointed at by `setSubregistry()` on the parent     name) mints `<label>.<family>.eth` as an ERC1155Singleton token owned by the AGENT     OPERATOR (true ownership \\u2014 the operator receives the ETH Registrar's canonical     REGISTRATION_ROLE_BITMAP), then writes the Standing Consent Window as ENS text records     on the pad's PermissionedResolver:       consent.window = active \\u00b7 consent.contact \\u00b7 pit \\u00b7 agent.manifest \\u00b7 agent.service \\u00b7 agent.id   Consent flip: `syncConsent()` rewrites consent.window (+contact/pit) \\u2014 the window any app     resolves in one lookup always mirrors the on-chain registry state. Authorization the pad performs once (documented in contracts/README.md):   UserRegistry.grantRootRoles(ROLE_REGISTRAR | ROLE_RENEW, issuer)   Resolver.grantRootRoles(ROLE_SET_TEXT, issuer)     (root scope covers every subname node)\",\"version\":1}},\"settings\":{\"compilationTarget\":{\"src/ENSv2SubnameIssuer.sol\":\"ENSv2SubnameIssuer\"},\"evmVersion\":\"cancun\",\"libraries\":{},\"metadata\":{\"bytecodeHash\":\"ipfs\"},\"optimizer\":{\"enabled\":true,\"runs\":800},\"remappings\":[\":@ensdomains/contracts-v2/=lib/contracts-v2/contracts/src/\",\":@openzeppelin/contracts/=lib/contracts-v2/contracts/lib/openzeppelin-contracts/contracts/\",\":buffer/=lib/contracts-v2/contracts/lib/buffer/contracts/\",\":contracts-v2/=lib/contracts-v2/\",\":ds-test/=lib/contracts-v2/contracts/lib/openzeppelin-contracts-v4/lib/forge-std/lib/ds-test/src/\",\":ens-contracts/=lib/contracts-v2/contracts/lib/ens-contracts/contracts/\",\":erc4626-tests/=lib/contracts-v2/contracts/lib/openzeppelin-contracts/lib/erc4626-tests/\",\":forge-std/=lib/forge-std/src/\",\":halmos-cheatcodes/=lib/contracts-v2/contracts/lib/openzeppelin-contracts/lib/halmos-cheatcod